<Base title="Sources and Method" description="Where our fuse box data comes from and how each diagram is checked.">
  <section class="prose">
    <h1>Sources and method</h1>
    <p>Fuse numbers, amp ratings and circuits come from the "Fuses" section of each vehicle's official owner's manual. Box locations use the manual's own wording.</p>
    <p>We draw the box layouts ourselves, so you can tap a fuse, search for a circuit and print a clean diagram. Each layout is compared against the manual's drawing before it goes live.</p>
    <p>Fuse colours follow the standard industry colour code for each amp rating. Always go by the number printed on the fuse.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
